      "Instant Milk Frother": "Reviewed’s best overall and the rare top pick that is also the cheapest, making billows of hot or cold foam in about two minutes with four settings. Buyer feedback is genuinely mixed, with many getting quick heat and great foam while others report units that stop heating or frothing within months.",
      "Capresso Froth Pro": "A three-heat-setting frother with a nonstick metal pitcher that delivered excellent texture in testing, a strong value pick. Buyers call it a great little appliance that froths even fat-free milk beautifully, with a nonstick pitcher that wipes clean and faster, easier results than stovetop steaming, though some units fail early.",
      "Capresso froth PLUS": "A versatile electric frother with a clear pitcher and easy fill lines that whips a full cup of foam from dairy or plant milks, and is dishwasher safe. Owners like it as an easy, dependable way to whip a full cup of foam from dairy or plant milk without a steam wand, with the dishwasher-safe pitcher a favorite touch.",
      "Subminimal NanoFoamer": "A premium handheld that pushes milk through a fine mesh screen for cafe-quality microfoam and latte art, a favorite of home baristas. Buyers call it easy to use and well-built, producing true microfoam from regular whole milk, though several report fragile tips and impellers wearing out with use.",
      "Zulay Milk Boss": "A best-selling battery handheld with a soft-touch handle and stainless whisk that aerates milk in seconds. Buyers love the powerful motor at 4.3 stars across 54,000 reviews.",
      "PowerLix Milk Frother": "A supercharged handheld that whips foam, whipped cream, and Dalgona coffee fast, with an included stand. Buyers call it a fantastic, powerful little frother that beats dragging out a blender, praising the frothing power and tidy stand and rating it well worth the price, though some units quit over time.",
      "Ninja Easy Frother": "A manual plunger-style frother, TechGearLab’s best plunger pick, that makes fluffy, voluminous froth in a few quick pumps and is dishwasher friendly. Owners like the no-battery simplicity, with a few quick pumps producing fluffy, voluminous froth and dishwasher-easy cleanup."
