      "A Bywater institution famous for Thursday-night brass band sessions and red beans, a quintessential New Orleans neighborhood dive with deep musical roots.",
    "The Old Point Bar (Algiers Point)":
      "A historic riverfront dive in Algiers Point with live local music and a porch near the Mississippi ferry, a beloved come-as-you-are neighborhood bar.",
    "Kingpin (Uptown)":
      "An Uptown Magazine Street dive with a kitschy velvet-and-Elvis theme, stiff drinks, and a devoted late-night crowd. A neighborhood favorite.",
